     H*****************************************************************
     A** WORKERS' COMP EMPLOYER PAYROLL FILE
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  SPECIAL FILE NOTES:                                          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  THE FOLLOWING FILES/PROGRAMS MUST BE MODIFIED ANYTIME A NEW  *
     H*  FIELD IS ADDED TO WMEPP:                                     *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - ANY FIELD THAT IS ADDED TO THIS FILE MUST ALSO BE ADDED    *
     H*    TO THE VERSION OF WMEPP IN THE QUOTE LIBRARY               *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - THE FIELD MUST ALSO BE ADDED TO WAELP (EMPLOYER PAYROLL    *
     H*    REVISED BILLING CHANGES) IN BOTH LIVE AND QUOTE            *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES (WMEPP/     *
     H*    WAEPP) IN THE MONTHEND LIBRARY (AT CLIENT SITE, NOT PDS)   *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES (WMEPP/     *
     H*    WMEPP) IN THE TEST ENVIRONMENT (AT CLIENT SITE, NOT PDS)   *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - THE FIELD MUST ALSO BE ADDED TO WMEPP IN CLIENT 03         *
     H*    LIBRARY WPEACOCK                                           *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - CHANGES MAY NEED TO BE MADE TO THE ROLLOVER PROGRAM        *
     H*    (W7820R) TO INITIALIZE THE NEW FIELD UPON ROLLOVER         *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - EMPLOYER PAYROLL MAINTENANCE WILL NEED TO BE MODIFIED      *
     H*    TO ALLOW INPUT INTO THE NEW FIELD SO THAT THE USER CAN     *
     H*    ASSIGN THE FIELD A VALUE                                   *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - RECOMPILE REVISED BILLING MAINTENANCE (W0090R) AS WELL     *
     H*    AS MAKING ANY NECESSARY CHANGES TO EMPLOYER DETAIL         *
     H*    INFORMATION THAT IS CHANGED THRU CMD 6.  ALSO MAKE ANY     *
     H*    CHANGES NECESSARY TO SCR02 OF REVISED BILLING (W0090R).    *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - RECOMPILE REVISED BILL FILE UPDATE PROGRAM (W8011R)        *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - RECOMPILE QUOTE TRANSFER PROGRAM (W8700R)                  *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - RECOMPILE DISCOUNT SUBROUTINE (SRDIS2)                     *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - AUDIT BILL CHANGES (W7720R, W7700R)                        *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - ORIGINAL/REVISED BILL CHANGES (W8010R, W7610/20R)          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - DAILY BATCH PROGRAM MAY REFER WMEPP IN BASE (WFIL)         *
     H*    SPECIFICALLY IN ANY CPYF FOR MONTHEND,  IF A CLIENT        *
     H*    VERSION IS BEING CREATED CPYF MUST BE CHANGED              *
     H*    ACCORDINGLY                                                *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - CHANGE OVRDBF COMMANDS IN QUOTE TRANSFER OVERRIDE PGM      *
     H*    (W8700C) TO REFER TO CHANGED FILE IN CORRECT LIBRARY       *
     H*                                                               *
     H*****************************************************************
